Welcome to Lumen Labs. This guide covers your first week and your first 90 days.

Day one. Collect your laptop from IT between 9:00 and 10:00. Your manager will introduce you to your onboarding buddy. Accounts for email, Slack and the expense portal are created before you arrive.

Week one. Complete the security training by Friday. Attend the Monday product walkthrough at 11:00 and the Wednesday company all-hands.

First 30 days. Learn the product and shadow two customer calls. Agree three goals with your manager.

Days 31 to 60. Own a small project from start to finish and present it at the team meeting.

Days 61 to 90. A review meeting with your manager and HR takes place on day 90.

Buddy system. Your buddy is a peer from another team. You meet weekly for the first 8 weeks. Your buddy is not your manager.
